    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Problem\n\nIt might be convenient to select `<pattern>` only within the visual selection.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe same behavior as `[count]Q`, but constrained to the selected range:\n\n```\ngg0\n/pattern\nn\nVj\n1Q\n```\n\n```\n1  <pattern>\n-------------------------- visual selection (V)\n2  ........  [x]<pattern>\n3  [x]<pattern>\n--------------------------\n2  ........ <pattern>\n```",
